won Lee</author> <category>AWS</category> <description>Bastion Host로 프라이빗 웹 서버에 접속하고 Gateway Endpoint와 IAM Role로 S3·DynamoDB에 게이트웨이 없이 접근하는 실습</description> <link>https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2021/04/17/vpc-endpoint-with-role/</link> <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 08:56:59 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/feed_rss_updated.xml">dotoryeee's blog</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2021/04/17/vpc-endpoint-with-role/</guid> <enclosure url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/assets/images/social/2021/04/17/vpc-endpoint-with-role.png" type="image/png" length="35452" /> </item> <item> <title>AI Gateway 정리</title> <author>Jeongwon Lee</author> <category>AI</category> <description>AI Gateway가 토큰 단위로 LLM 트래픽을 통제하는 원리와 LiteLLM·Kong·Portkey·Cloudflare·Envoy 5종 비교, 가드레일 설계까지 정리</description> <link>https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2026/07/20/ai-gateway-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</link> <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 08:56:59 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/feed_rss_updated.xml">dotoryeee's blog</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2026/07/20/ai-gateway-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</guid> <enclosure url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/assets/images/social/2026/07/20/ai-gateway-정리.png" type="image/png" length="36280" /> </item> <item> <title>LiteLLM으로 AI Gateway 구축과 운영</title> <author>Jeongwon Lee</author> <category>AI</category> <description>LiteLLM Proxy와 Ollama 로컬 모델로 게이트웨이를 세워 라우팅·폴백·캐시 히트·예산 차단·프로메테우스 관측까지 응답 헤더로 실측한 기록</description> <link>https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2026/07/20/litellm%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C-ai-gateway-%EA%B5%AC%EC%B6%95%EA%B3%BC-%EC%9A%B4%EC%98%81/</link> <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 08:56:59 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/feed_rss_updated.xml">dotoryeee's blog</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2026/07/20/litellm%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C-ai-gateway-%EA%B5%AC%EC%B6%95%EA%B3%BC-%EC%9A%B4%EC%98%81/</guid> <enclosure